## TripSummaryWidget (Apple, P4 · 0103) — shipped & verified

Built a production-polished native SwiftUI parity of `features/dashboard/widgets/TripSummaryWidget.tsx` — **8 files**, all under the allowed `apps/apple/TeslaSync/dashboard-widgets/TripSummaryWidget.*` prefix, committed as `83cf84688` (+ gate log).

**Architecture** (mirrors the accepted `RecentDrivesListWidget` template, uniquely `TripSummary*`-namespaced):
- `.Model` — P1/S8 state-holder seam (`TripSummarySource`→`TripSummaryModel`, no view HTTP), P1/S11 `view.opened` telemetry (slug `TripSummaryWidget`), registry (`trip-summary`, 2×4/1×2/4×40), P1/S10 i18n facade.
